      10 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">استنجث شَيْئًا</span></b>  <i>He exposed himself to a thing;</i>
or <i>ventured upon it:</i> (S, K, TA:) <i>he devoted
himself eagerly to it, and set about it,</i> or <i>commenced it.</i> (TA.) ― 
